.TH I2CKISS 8 "August 2026" "i2ckiss-ng 2.0.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
i2ckiss \- bridge a TNC-Pi I2C endpoint to a KISS pseudo-terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B i2ckiss
.RI [ options ]
.I i2cbus i2cdevice
.B symlink
.I linkname
.br
.B i2ckiss
.RI [ options ]
.I i2cbus i2cdevice port inetaddr
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B i2ckiss
connects a TNC-Pi or TNC-Black I2C interface to a newly allocated KISS
pseudo-terminal. In symlink mode it publishes the PTY at
.IR linkname .
In AX.25 mode it starts and supervises
.BR kissattach (8)
using
.I port
and
.IR inetaddr .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-p " " N , " " \-\-poll-ticks " " N
Poll every
.I N
times 100 milliseconds. The default is 1.
.TP
.BI \-\-poll-ms " N"
Set the polling interval directly in milliseconds.
.TP
.BR \-m " " N , " " \-\-mtu " " N
Pass MTU
.I N
to
.BR kissattach (8).
.TP
.BR \-d , " " \-\-debug
Increase diagnostic output. May be repeated.
.TP
.BR \-l , " " \-\-syslog
Write messages through syslog.
.TP
.BR \-D , " " \-\-daemon
Detach from the terminal. Foreground operation is the default.
.TP
.BR \-f , " " \-\-foreground
Remain in the foreground.
.TP
.B \-\-no-reset
Skip the reset sequence after connecting or reconnecting.
.TP
.BI \-\-retry-min-ms " N"
Set the initial I2C reconnect delay. The default is 250 ms.
.TP
.BI \-\-retry-max-ms " N"
Set the maximum I2C reconnect delay. The default is 30000 ms.
.TP
.BI \-\-byte-delay-us " N"
Set the delay between transmitted I2C bytes. The default is 1000 microseconds.
.TP
.BI \-\-reset-delay-ms " N"
Set the delay after a TNC reset. The default is 2000 ms.
.TP
.BI \-\-lock-dir " PATH"
Store per-bus/address instance locks under
.IR PATH .
The default is
.IR /run/lock .
.TP
.BR \-v , " " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h , " " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.BR SIGTERM , " " SIGINT , " " SIGHUP
Shut down cleanly and remove the service-owned PTY link.
.TP
.B SIGUSR1
Write current frame, byte, error, reconnect, and drop counters to the log.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /dev/i2c-N
Linux I2C device selected by
.IR i2cbus .
.TP
.I /run/lock/i2ckiss-*.lock
Per-I2C-endpoint ownership locks.
.TP
.I /etc/i2ckiss/INSTANCE.conf
Options read by the supplied systemd template.
.TP
.I /run/i2ckiss-INSTANCE/pty
Service-lifetime link to the allocated PTY.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kissattach (8),
.BR systemd.service (5),
.BR tmpfiles.d (5)
